{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/111404","id":2896791614,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc6sqYg-","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/111404","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/111404.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/111404.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/111404","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/111404/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/111404/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/111404/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/e353177985174121884f0073fc1ffe7e43edbb2c","number":111404,"state":"open","locked":false,"title":"Input: Improve multiplayer support by implementing `PlayerID`","user":{"login":"GreenCrowDev","id":62719360,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYyNzE5MzYw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/62719360?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/GreenCrowDev","html_url":"https://github.com/GreenCrowDev","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GreenCrowDev/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GreenCrowDev/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GreenCrowDev/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GreenCrowDev/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GreenCrowDev/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GreenCrowDev/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GreenCrowDev/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GreenCrowDev/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GreenCrowDev/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Partially supersedes #102412.\r\nImplements some parts of https://github.com/godotengine/godot-proposals/issues/10070.\r\n\r\n## Goal\r\n\r\nThe main goal is to easily distinguish input events for different players through code, instead of relying on input map assignments (where you’d normally create a separate action for each player mapped to a different device).\r\nThis also allows you to share devices (like a keyboard) between multiple players with just a bit of code tweaking.\r\nCompatibility is preserved by using defult arguments.\r\n\r\n## How to use it\r\n\r\n```gdscript\r\n# Player 1.\r\nif Input.is_action_just_pressed(\"ui_accept\", false, PLAYER_ID_P1): # Input.is_action_just_pressed(\"ui_accept\", false) is equivalent.\r\n    print(\"P1 ui_accept just pressed\")\r\n\r\n# Player 2.\r\nif Input.is_action_just_pressed(\"ui_accept\", false, PLAYER_ID_P2):\r\n    print(\"P2 ui_accept just pressed\")\r\n\r\n# Assign device 0 to player 2.\r\nInput.set_joy_player_id(0, PLAYER_ID_P2)\r\n```\r\n\r\n## Content\r\n\r\nThis PR is based on @coffeebeats proposal [Improve local multiplayer support by tracking InputEvents and UI focus per player](https://github.com/godotengine/godot-proposals/issues/10070).\r\nThe author stated in the discussion:\r\n\r\n> I think there are two sub-problems here: (1) segmenting input by player via a \"player layer\" and (2) allowing the engine to track UI focus for each player individually.\r\n\r\nOnly point 1 will be addressed in this PR (while point 2 will be eventually discussed and implemented in a future PR):\r\n1. Introducing a new `player` layer between the device and game logic;\r\n\r\nThe max amount of players allowed is 8.\r\n\r\n## Changes\r\n\r\n* `PlayerID` is a new enum class that is used to assign and check inputs to different players;\r\n* Methods like `Input::is_action_pressed` now have new `PlayerID` optional parameter to check which player emitted the input;\r\n* `InputMap` action events binded to joypad devices are now set to `ALL_DEVICES` by default. This is because now the common practice to filter players is to use `PlayerID`. The possibility of choosing from `InputMap` the device id for the event is preserved to allow custom behaviours, but it is not intended as the common use case;\r\n* Keyboard, mouse, and touch inputs can be assigned to players other than `P1` through `keyboard_player_id_override`, `mouse_player_id_override`, `touch_player_id_override`;\r\n* When a new device is connected, a `PlayerID` is assigned to it in a cumulative way (device 0 -> P1, device 1 -> P2);","labels":[{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","description":"","color":"aaccff","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":890310664,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw4OTAzMTA2NjQ=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:input","name":"topic:input","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":8237783,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AfbLX","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/16","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/16","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/16/labels","number":16,"state":"open","title":"4.x","description":"Issues and pull requests slated for an undetermined Godot 4 release.","creator":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4701338?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga","html_url":"https://github.com/akien-mga","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"htt